    LLM: 'Game: 31. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '31 (Scat) is a knock game. Get 31 points in one suit (A=11, face=10, number=face value) or highest three-card hand. Draw one, discard one. Knock when confident; lowest hand loses a life. Blitz: 31 in three cards declared immediately; others lose a life. Last player with lives wins.',
    objective: 'Highest three-card hand (same suit total or high card). Avoid lowest when someone knocks.',
